<LegalLayout title="Cookie Policy" updated="August 2026">

<p>This Cookie Policy explains how CappadociaGo (operated by Cappadocia Kaphera Travel Agency, TÜRSAB No: 18577) uses cookies and similar technologies on our website.</p>

<h2>1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
<p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help the website remember your preferences, understand how you use the site, and improve your overall experience.</p>

<h2>2. Types of Cookies We Use</h2>
<h3>Essential Cookies</h3>
<p>These cookies are necessary for the website to function properly — for example, remembering your selected dates and tour in the booking widget, or your chosen language. The website cannot function properly without these.</p>

<h3>Analytics Cookies</h3>
<p>We use analytics cookies to understand how visitors use our website (e.g. which pages are most visited, how long visitors stay), which helps us improve our content and services. This data is aggregated and does not directly identify you.</p>

<h3>Functional Cookies</h3>
<p>These remember choices you make (such as currency or language preference) to provide a more personalized experience on return visits.</p>

<h3>Marketing Cookies</h3>
<p>Where enabled, these cookies may be used to show you relevant offers about our tours on other platforms. We only use marketing cookies with your consent.</p>

<h2>3. Third-Party Cookies</h2>
<p>Some cookies may be placed by trusted third-party services we use, such as payment processors, WhatsApp Business messaging, or website analytics providers. These third parties have their own privacy and cookie policies, which we encourage you to review.</p>

<h2>4. Managing Your Cookie Preferences</h2>
<p>You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings at any time. Most browsers allow you to refuse cookies, delete existing cookies, or receive a notification before a cookie is stored. Please note that disabling essential cookies may affect the functionality of our booking system.</p>

<h2>5. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time to reflect changes in the cookies we use or for legal reasons. Please check back periodically for updates.</p>

<h2>6. Contact</h2>
<p>If you have any questions about our use of cookies, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@kapheratravel.com">info@kapheratravel.com</a>.</p>

</LegalLayout>
